# Normalise line endings in the repository, check out native.
* text=auto

# Each engine is a build artifact whose exact bytes are recorded in an
# engine/PROVENANCE*.json and checked by tests/run_engine_test.js. Emscripten
# emits CRLF here; normalising it would rewrite the glue and break that hash on
# a checkout with different line endings, so keep git away from the engine
# entirely. The patterns are deliberately wider than the engines that exist
# today, so a third one is covered the day it lands.
engine/*.js -text
engine/*.wasm binary
